# This directory stores rendered font glyph bitmaps
# Generated by dataset.py --render-fonts

# Files created here:
# - rendered_glyphs.npz (compressed numpy array containing all rendered glyphs)
#   Structure: {images, chars, fonts, font_paths}
#   - images: (N, 48, 48) uint8 array of glyph bitmaps
#   - chars: (N,) array of character codes
#   - fonts: (N,) array of font indices  
#   - font_paths: list of font file paths used